{"id":"42b5ac7685998854","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-context-category.md","title":"依赖语境范畴","display":"df-context-category — 依赖语境范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-context-category","aliases":["16-df-context-category","Context category","16-context-category"],"display":"df-context-category — 依赖语境范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"source":"§10.3, pp. 602–604 (PDF 622–624)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-context-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-context-category</span><span>Context category</span><span>16-context-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-context-category — 依赖语境范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b40125e21710f48\" href=\"?note=3b40125e21710f48\" title=\"16-df-syntactic-substitution\">16-df-syntactic-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§10.3, pp. 602–604 (PDF 622–624)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b40125e21710f48\" href=\"?note=3b40125e21710f48\" title=\"16-df-syntactic-substitution\">16-df-syntactic-substitution</a> 的依赖演算；上下文、项均按捕获避免的 α 换名识别。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对象采用良构语境本身；态射按逐分量判断相等取商，并带其源、靶语境标签。此呈现不再额外对对象取类型转换商。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\sigma]:\\Gamma\\to\\Delta\">\\([\\sigma]:\\Gamma\\to\\Delta\\)</span> 简写完整记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\mid\\Sigma\\vdash\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\},\\\\\nM_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle\\mid\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in O_\\Sigma\\land\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\},\\\\\ns_\\Sigma\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma,\\qquad\nt_\\Sigma\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle\\coloneqq\\Delta,\\\\\ne_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma,\\Gamma,[\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma]_\\equiv\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\Sigma(\\langle\\Delta,\\Theta,[\\tau]_\\equiv\\rangle,\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta,[\\tau\\circ\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\Sigma,M_\\Sigma,s_\\Sigma,t_\\Sigma,e_\\Sigma,c_\\Sigma\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)&amp;=\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle\\mid\n\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\mid\\Sigma\\vdash\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\},\\\\\nM_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle\\mid\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in O_\\Sigma\\land\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\},\\\\\ns_\\Sigma\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\\Gamma,\\qquad\nt_\\Sigma\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle\\coloneqq\\Delta,\\\\\ne_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma,\\Gamma,[\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma]_\\equiv\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\Sigma(\\langle\\Delta,\\Theta,[\\tau]_\\equiv\\rangle,\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta,[\\tau\\circ\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\Sigma,M_\\Sigma,s_\\Sigma,t_\\Sigma,e_\\Sigma,c_\\Sigma\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)&amp;=\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle\\mid\n\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma)&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>完整标签保证源靶为全箭头集上的单值函数。例如指向空语境的空替换可来自不同源语境，不能把所有这些空元组当成同一范畴箭头。</li>\n<li>证明：替换引理给出复合闭性，相等的同余性给出良定义性，替换结合与单位定律给出范畴公理。</li>\n<li>空语境是终对象，因为指向空语境的项元组唯一；语境扩张的投影是忘掉最后一个变量的替换。</li>\n<li>若对语境再取判断相等商，必须连同依赖 Hom 的运输一起规定；此处选用本书直接的语境呈现。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§10.3, pp. 602–604 (PDF 622–624)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-syntactic-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"3b40125e21710f48","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-syntactic-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"3b40125e21710f48","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-syntactic-substitution]] 的依赖演算；上下文、项均按捕获避免的 α 换名识别。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-category]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"[\\sigma]:\\Gamma\\to\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\mid\\Sigma\\vdash\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}\\},\\\\\nM_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle\\mid\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in O_\\Sigma\\land\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\},\\\\\ns_\\Sigma\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle&\\coloneqq\\Gamma,\\qquad\nt_\\Sigma\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle\\coloneqq\\Delta,\\\\\ne_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)&\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma,\\Gamma,[\\operatorname{id}_\\Gamma]_\\equiv\\rangle,\\\\\nc_\\Sigma(\\langle\\Delta,\\Theta,[\\tau]_\\equiv\\rangle,\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\langle\\Gamma,\\Theta,[\\tau\\circ\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma&\\coloneqq\\langle O_\\Sigma,M_\\Sigma,s_\\Sigma,t_\\Sigma,e_\\Sigma,c_\\Sigma\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)&=\\{\\langle\\Gamma,\\Delta,[\\sigma]_\\equiv\\rangle\\mid\n\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\Delta)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma)&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2534,"backlinks":[{"id":"004562375f0e2ba1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"带指数的简单类型演算另有 [[16-df-stlc-syntactic-category]]；依赖语境另有 [[16-df-context-category]]。本页不把这三种不同的语法接口混成一个未经展开的 $\\Sigma$。"},{"id":"f56a33992af66ae1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ 是 [[16-df-context-category]] 所采用的有限强一阶展示。"},{"id":"7d6e82f8b4b6d41d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal T_\\Sigma$ 与 [[16-df-context-category]] 的原始语境范畴呈现不同：这里还对语境的逐型属判断相等取商，并显式规定了全部运输。旧范畴仍可用于 display-map 构造；二者不能在公式中未经说明当成同一记录。这里的商确保类型判断相等引起的语境扩张也严格相等，从而无需选择类型代表来定义 split CwF。"},{"id":"58c65ff26967e699","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[16-df-set]] 的 Grothendieck 宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$，包含有限签名 $\\Sigma$ 的全部符号、有限语法树及其商集。$\\mathbf{Ctx}_\\Sigma$ 采用 [[16-df-context-category]]，其对象是良构原始语境；$\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta$ 为这些对象。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]、[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]、[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]、[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]、[[16-df-eff-topos]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]、[[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-per-category]]、[[16-df-ufam-per]]、[[16-df-context-category]]、[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]、[[16-df-type-functor]]、[[16-df-term-functor]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]、[[16-thm-reynolds]]。"}],"outgoing":["3b40125e21710f48","25a281534aa42440"]}